<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
  Agent Governor deployment manifest.

  Explicit list of every component in this package (no wildcards), so a
  manifest-based deploy or retrieve moves exactly the Agent Governor metadata
  and nothing else in the org. Keep this file in step with force-app when
  components are added or removed.

  Deploy with the manifest flag, e.g.:
    sf project deploy start (manifest) manifest/package.xml (target-org) ALIAS
  A source-tree deploy that points at the force-app directory does not read
  this file; it deploys the whole directory. Either route deploys the same set.
-->
